From 0c04f1aaae7c7ab77afe4ad07da8f00eb7a2d0e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Catherine Grabar <catherine.grabar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:48:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] M2 step 7: versioned SaveGame v1 with migration hook +
 autosave on sleep

- systems/sim/save_game.gd: capture/restore of SimWorld grids + GameState
  fields; version field and stepwise migration chain from the first save
  we ever ship; JSON normalization so a loaded save is value-identical
- main.gd: write-only autosave (user://autosave.json) and session replay
  dump (user://session_replay.json) after each sleep; loading waits on
  the continue/new-game menu (M1 scope)
- Tests: round-trip value-identity, field restoration, unknown-version
  refusal (unit 152/152, integration 20/20)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
